<title>UK: London grain fixtures.</title>
<headline>London grain fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>TBN - 25,000 tonnes wheat St. Lawrence river/Algeria $23 fio five days/1,500 15-25/4 CNAN (fixed recently).</p>
<p>Halla Fortune - 54,000 tonnes hss USG/Japan $23.75 no combo fio 11 days 28/4-12/5 Keoyang.</p>
<p>TBN - 55,000 tonnes hss Santos/Cont $21 fio five days/5,000 ppt Alliance.</p>
<p>Verdon - 25,000 tonnes wheat St. Lawrence/Callao $21 fio five days/5,000 ppt Alliance.</p>
</text>
